41.8133062]}}, {"activity_id": "579461", "type": "Event", "title": "Hot Cocoa & Toy Giveaway at LeClaire-Hearst", "description": "Join us for hot chocolate, holiday-themed crafts &amp; games, pinata and music for the whole family. There will also be a toy giveaway!", "start_date": "2026-12-19T12:00:00.000", "end_date": "2026-12-19T15:00:00.000", "season": "2026 Events", "zone": "2026 Events: Night Out in the Parks", "location_facility": "LeClaire-Hearst Park", "age_range": "At least 5 but less than 7", "category": "Holidays", "fee": "0", "information_link": {"url": "https://www.chicagoparkdistrict.com/events/hot-cocoa-toy-giveaway-leclaire-hearst-0"}, "registration_link": {"url": "http://apm.activecommunities.com/chicagoparkdistrict/Activity_Search/579461"}, "event_cancelled": "N", "address": "5120 W. 44th St.", "zip": "60638", "latitude": "41.8133062", "longitude": "-87.7513488", "location": {"type": "Point", "coordinates": [-87.7513488, 41.8133062]}}, {"activity_id": "582836", "type": "Event", "title": "Mitote Día De Los Muertos in La Ronda Parakata at Burnham", "description": "Mitote is a traditional náhuatl term that includes gathering, dance, and celebration. Come join in ancestral Aztec Dance, to honor the natural elements in coordinated physical movement with drumming and music, make art, and build community to deepen our connections to land and caring for our future generations.", "start_date": "2026-10-24T12:00:00.000", "end_date": "2026-10-24T15:00:00.000", "season": "2026 Events", "zone": "2026 Events: Night Out in the Parks-FEATURED", "location_facility": "Burnham (Daniel) Park", "category": "Family Fun, Night Out in the Parks, Arts &amp; Culture", "fee": "0", "image_link": {"url": "https://files.chicagoparkdistrict.com/2026-05/Tiahui-Xicago%2C-Rene-Diaz-2.jpg?VersionId=lu7LgraqH_9GJ0sCc4E92HXS34bSzU.s"}, "information_link": {"url": "https://www.chicagoparkdistrict.com/events/mitote-dia-de-los-muertos-la-ronda-parakata-burnham"}, "registration_link": {"url": "http://apm.activecommunities.com/chicagoparkdistrict/Activity_Search/582836"}, "event_cancelled": "N", "address": "1200-5700 S. Jean-Baptiste Pointe DuSable Lake Shore Drive", "zip": "60615", "latitude": "41.7952713", "longitude": "-87.5773205", "location": {"type": "Point", "coordinates": [-87.5773205, 41.7952713]}}, {"activity_id": "582935", "type": "Event", "title": "Joel Hall Dancers & Center: NextGen at Douglass", "description": "Joel Hall Dancers &amp; Center presents an electrifying evening of performances  that awakens the dancer in everyone's soul. This program features a blend of performances from the Joel Hall Dancers and its Trainee Program, spotlighting emerging Chicago dance talent, and concludes with a public dance class that invites audiences to experience the artistry firsthand. Joel Hall Dancers &amp; Center: NextGen celebrates Chicago through the universal language of dance, proving exceptional artistry thrives when barriers fall and communities dance together. Special Guest Performance: The Douglass Park Performing Company (DPPC) presents, \"Respect.\"  Twelve electrifying performers will take the stage in a Jazz Funk Dance piece that pulses with joy, rhythm, and connection. \"Respect\", channels high-energy movement and an inspiring spirit of togetherness, showcasing how positivity can move a community.Choreography by Elaine McLaurin and Kirby Reed", "start_date": "2026-10-23T18:00:00.000", "end_date": "2026-10-23T19:30:00.000", "season": "2026 Events", "zone": "2026 Events: Night Out in the Parks-FEATURED", "location_facility": "Douglass (Anna and Frederick) Park", "category": "Dance, Night Out in the Parks, Arts &amp; Culture, Cultural Center Events", "fee": "0", "image_link": {"url": "https://files.chicagoparkdistrict.com/archived/311226/Joel%20Hall%20Dance%20-%20NextGen.jpg?VersionId=aKHqx2CNcA9p2WEcLpT.WYlh1MFmPfMj"}, "information_link": {"url": "https://www.chicagoparkdistrict.com/events/joel-hall-dancers-center-nextgen-douglass"}, "